// Windows resource script (configured by CMake from msga.rc.in).
// Embeds the application icon into msga.exe.
//
// Explorer/the taskbar pick the icon with the numerically-lowest resource id,
// so this stays id 1. The .ico is multi-resolution (16-256 px) so Windows can
// pick the right size for the taskbar, alt-tab, and the large-icon view.
//
// NOTE: do NOT add a VS_VERSION_INFO block here. The static mingw/Qt link
// already contributes a VERSION resource (name 1, lang 0x409); a second one
// makes windres' .rsrc merge fail with "duplicate leaf: type VERSION". If we
// ever want to control the version metadata, do it via Qt's target properties
// (QT_TARGET_VERSION / QT_TARGET_DESCRIPTION / ...), which feed the single
// generated resource instead of adding a competing one.
1 ICON "@MSGA_ICON_PATH@"
